# ================= your line, per like =================
@rule me.small.animals
on me.small
when likeid=animals
- [Are you a cat person or a dog person?|Do you have any pets?|I saw a stray cat by the gate this morning.]
- [If you could have any animal, what would it be?|Have you been to the cat café by the station?]
- [Do you think dogs dream?|What's the cutest animal you've ever seen?|Would you rather have a cat or a hamster?]
- [Did you ever have a pet growing up?|What was your first pet?]
- [There's a dog at the park that looks just like the principal.|I think a crow is following me home.] [Have you seen it?|Is that normal?]
- [Birds or fish?|Rabbits or hamsters?|Big dogs or small dogs?]
- [Do animals usually like you?|Are you good with animals?]
- [Have you met the courtyard cat?|Does the school have a pet? It should.]

@rule me.small.food
on me.small
when likeid=food
- [What's the best thing you've eaten lately?|Do you have a favorite restaurant?|I'm hungry just thinking about it, but what's your favorite food?]
- [If you could only eat one thing forever, what would it be?|Any good places to eat around here?]
- [Bread from the store, or homemade bento?|What did you have for lunch?|What's a food you could never stand?]
- [What's your comfort food?|What do you eat when you're down?]
- [Sweet or salty?|Ramen or curry?|Meat or fish?]
- [What's the weirdest thing you've ever eaten?|Do you eat anything odd that nobody knows about?]
- [If I treat you, what do I buy?|What would you order right now?]
- [Is there anything you can't eat?|What's good at the cafeteria today?]

@rule me.small.cooking
on me.small
when likeid=cooking
- [Do you cook?|Did you make your own lunch today?|What's the best thing you can cook?]
- [Could you teach me a recipe sometime?|Do you cook at home a lot?]
- [What's your signature dish?|Ever burned something really badly?|Do you cook for your family?]
- [What was the first thing you ever cooked?|Who taught you how to cook?]
- [Is that bento homemade?|Did you make that yourself?]
- [I can't even fry an egg. Can you?|Is cooking hard to learn?]
- [What should I make if I want to impress someone?|What's an easy recipe for a beginner?]
- [Do you cook from recipes, or by feel?|Knife skills or seasoning, what matters most?]

@rule me.small.exercise
on me.small
when likeid=exercise
- [Do you work out?|You look like you run a lot.|What sport do you like best?]
- [Morning runs or evening runs?|Ever think about joining a sports club?]
- [How many laps can you run?|Do you stretch before class?|What's your favorite way to stay in shape?]
- [Are you sore from P.E.?|How was P.E. for you?]
- [What's your personal best?|What's your best event?]
- [Can you do a split?|How many push-ups can you do?]
- [How do you stay motivated?|Don't you ever want to skip a day?]
- [Teach me how to run without dying.|Would you train with me sometime?]

@rule me.small.study
on me.small
when likeid=study
- [What's your best subject?|Do you study a lot at home?|How do you keep your grades up?]
- [Library or home, where do you study better?|Got any study tricks?]
- [How do you survive exam season?|Which teacher do you think explains best?|Do you study with music on?]
- [Did you get the last math problem?|What did you get for the homework?]
- [How long do you study every day?|Do you ever take a break?]
- [Which subject do you hate?|Is there any subject you can't stand?]
- [Could you look at my notes?|Would you explain this to me sometime?]
- [What's your secret for memorizing things?|How did you get such good grades?]

@rule me.small.fashion
on me.small
when likeid=fashion
- [Where do you buy your clothes?|You always look put together.|What's in style these days?]
- [If you weren't in uniform, what would you wear?|Got a favorite brand?]
- [What's the best outfit you own?|Would you ever dye your hair?|Do you dress up on weekends?]
- [Where did you get that hairpin?|Did you do something new with your hair?]
- [Is that bag new?|I like your style, by the way.]
- [Bright colors or dark?|Skirts or pants?|Cute or cool?]
- [What should I wear on the weekend?|Could you pick something for me to wear?]
- [Do you follow any models?|What's your favorite shop at the mall?]

@rule me.small.coffee
on me.small
when likeid=coffee
- [Coffee or tea?|How do you take your coffee?|Do you drink coffee every day?]
- [Know any good cafés?|Can you really drink it black?]
- [Canned coffee from the machine, or the real stuff?|How many cups a day?|Ever had coffee jelly?]
- [Are you awake yet, or do you need a cup?|Did you have your coffee this morning?]
- [Hot or iced?|Milk or sugar?|Latte or black?]
- [Is the machine by the gym any good?|What's the best thing at the vending machine?]
- [How did you get into coffee?|When did you start drinking it?]
- [Is the coffee at the school store any good?|Could you really tell cheap beans from good ones?]

@rule me.small.spicy
on me.small
when likeid=spicy
- [Can you handle spicy food?|What's the spiciest thing you've ever eaten?|Do you like hot curry?]
- [Ever tried the ghost pepper chips?|How spicy do you go at the ramen place?]
- [How many chili peppers can you handle on the menu?|Ever cried eating curry?|Mapo tofu: mild or extra hot?]
- [Have you ever cried over a bowl of ramen?|What's the hottest ramen you've finished?]
- [Do you put chili on everything?|Do you carry hot sauce with you?]
- [Is the cafeteria curry hot enough for you?|Is level five at the curry shop hard?]
- [How do you stand the heat?|Doesn't your mouth hurt?]
- [Milk or water, what actually helps?|What do you drink with something that hot?]

@rule me.small.sweets
on me.small
when likeid=sweets
- [Do you have a sweet tooth?|What's your favorite dessert?|Cake or ice cream?]
- [Know any good sweet shops?|Do you bake sweets yourself?]
- [Melon bread or cream puff?|What's the best sweet at the convenience store?|Ever eaten a whole cake by yourself?]
- [What's your go-to snack?|Do you always carry candy?]
- [Chocolate or strawberry?|Mochi or pudding?|Crepes or parfaits?]
- [What's the best dessert in this town?|Where do you go for cake?]
- [Have you ever tried the new pudding at the store?|Did you see the new crepe stand?]
- [How do you eat that much sugar?|Is there such a thing as too much cake?]

