- [Any big plans for the {club}?|Is the {club} doing anything for the festival?]
- [Who's in charge of the {club}?|Do you get along with everyone at the {club}?]
- [Could I drop by the {club} sometime?|Is it okay for outsiders to watch the {club}?]

