- [Today's said I'd have a meeting with someone important.|Mine said to watch for an unexpected encounter.] [Hm.|Is that you?]
- [I read it every morning, but I only believe the good ones.|I only trust it when it's nice to me.] [Everyone does that.|Hehe.]
- [What's your sign? Let me see if we match.|Tell me yours, and I'll tell you what it means.] [I've got a chart.|Come on.]
- [Fate or not, it's fun.|I don't really believe it, but I don't skip it either.] [Don't laugh.|Mm.]

@rule react.ask.club
on react
